{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列「」中的字，讀讀讀讀音音音音不不不不同同同同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "「柴」火／「豺」狼／同「儕」", "B": "「耆」老／「臍」帶／神「祇」", "C": "信「箋」／鞍「韉」／「殲」滅", "D": "軒「轅」／牆「垣」／罰「鍰」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 55.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 72.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 63.0, 53.0, 46.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句「」中的字詞，意義相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "是以先帝簡拔以「遺」陛下／小學而大「遺」，吾未見其明也", "B": "足反居上，首「顧」居下／三「顧」臣於草廬之中", "C": "生乎吾前，其聞道也，「固」先乎吾／事行身死，「固」所願也", "D": "攜手上河梁，遊子暮何「之」／「之」子于歸，宜其家室"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 59.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 80.0, 73.0, 67.0, 54.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列書信用語，敘述正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "「世兄」可以用來稱呼晚輩", "B": "給師長寫信，信首提稱語要用「硯右」", "C": "書信結尾的問候語，「敬請 金安」多用於商界", "D": "給師長寫信，為了表示敬意，結尾署名時要稱「愚生」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 56.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 58.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 6.0, "p_high": 10.0, "p_low": 4.0, "discrimination": 6.0, "p_quintiles": [13.0, 6.0, 4.0, 3.0, 5.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "古人名與字往往有意義上的聯繫，或相關，如孟軻字子輿；或相反，如韓愈字退\n之。依此推論，則班固、許慎、王弼、朱熹四人的字依序應是：", "options": {"A": "孟堅／叔重／輔嗣／元晦", "B": "元晦／輔嗣／叔重／孟堅", "C": "叔重／輔嗣／孟堅／元晦", "D": "叔重／元晦／輔嗣／孟堅"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 74.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 45.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 50.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 91.0, 83.0, 66.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "詩人描寫事物時，往往兼顧視覺與聽覺，以達成「有聲有色」的效果。如王維〈山\n居秋暝〉：「明月松間照，清泉石上流。竹喧歸浣女，蓮動下漁舟。」便是藉由「視\n覺—聽覺、聽覺—視覺」的交錯書寫，以營造意境。下列寫法完全相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "岸上北風急，紛紛飛荻花。賈船停擁浪，江戍遠吹笳", "B": "雨後明月來，照見下山路。人語隔谿煙，借問停舟處", "C": "古剎疏鐘度，遙嵐破月懸。沙頭敲石火，燒燭照漁船", "D": "古木無人徑，深山何處鐘。泉聲咽危石，日色冷青松\n- 1 -\n100年學測 第 2 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 91.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 98.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 81.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 81.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 97.0, 95.0, 92.0, 74.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列是一段古文，請依文意選出排列順序最恰當的選項：\n楚文王少時好獵，有一人獻一鷹。\n甲、故為獵於雲夢，罝網雲布，烟燒漲天，\n乙、此鷹軒頸瞪目，遠視雲際，無搏噬之志，\n丙、王曰:「吾鷹所獲以百數，汝鷹曾無奮意，將欺余耶？」\n丁、文王見之，爪短神爽，殊絕常鷹，\n戊、毛群飛旋，爭噬競搏，\n獻者曰:「若效於雉兔，臣豈敢獻？」（劉義慶《幽明錄》）", "options": {"A": "甲乙戊丙丁", "B": "丁甲戊乙丙", "C": "戊丁乙甲丙", "D": "丁甲丙乙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 96.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 94.0, 90.0, 82.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下文，選出不不不不正正正正確確確確的選項：\n老年人常思既往，少年人常思將來。惟思既往也，事事皆其所已經者，故惟知照\n例；惟思將來也，事事皆其所未經者，故常敢破格。老年人常厭事，少年人常喜\n事。惟厭事也，故常覺一切事無可為者；惟喜事也，故常覺一切事無不可為者。\n老年人如夕照，少年人如朝陽；老年人如瘠牛，少年人如乳虎；老年人如僧，少\n年人如俠；老年人如字典，少年人如戲文；老年人如秋後之柳，少年人如春前之\n草。（梁啟超〈少年中國說〉）", "options": {"A": "本文認為老年人因厭事而保守且行事消極", "B": "「老年人如字典，少年人如戲文」是說人生無常", "C": "本文認為少年人著眼未來故勇於多方嘗試", "D": "「少年人如乳虎」比喻少年人充滿活力積極奮發"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 79.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 91.0, 85.0, 75.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "以下為同一系列的三首小詩：\n〈椅子和我〉\n椅子，獨自坐著／我站在它旁邊\n時間慢慢走過\n〈蘆葦〉\n沉思\n蘆花／在秋風中／越搖越\n白\n〈我想到的〉\n熄了燈，我才開始發亮；／因為我想到的每一個字／都成了寒夜裡的星星\n（錄自林煥彰作品）\n這一系列組詩，最適合做為共同詩題的選項是：", "options": {"A": "偶然的遭遇", "B": "淒涼的晚景", "C": "孤獨的時刻", "D": "虛擲的光陰\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 100年學測\n共 7 頁 國文考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 32.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 23.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 39.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 65.0, 58.0, 54.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "白先勇在他的小說《臺北人》一書中，寫出了當年隨政府自大陸來臺定居人物的\n生活和心情。這些人多半擁有光輝耀眼的過去，以及難忘難捨的記憶，與平淡平\n凡的現況對照，「昔盛今衰、繁華不再」的感受特別強烈。依此特點，如要選擇\n一段詩詞做為該書的注腳，最適合的選項是：", "options": {"A": "萬戶傷心生野煙，百官何日再朝天？秋槐花落空宮裡，凝碧池頭奏管絃", "B": "曾隨織女渡天河，記得雲間第一歌。休唱貞元供奉曲，當時朝士已無多", "C": "林花謝了春紅，太匆匆，無奈朝來寒雨晚來風。 胭脂淚，相留醉，幾時重，\n自是人生長恨水長東", "D": "一向年光有限身，等閒離別易銷魂，酒筵歌席莫辭頻。 滿目山河空念遠，落\n花風雨更傷春，不如憐取眼前人"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 53.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 60.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 41.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 25.0, "p_high": 29.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 8.0, "p_quintiles": [31.0, 26.0, 23.0, 22.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "最能凸顯以上二段引文描寫上共同特色的選項是：", "options": {"A": "人物", "B": "對話", "C": "情節", "D": "場景"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "10-11", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 82.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 62.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 62.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 78.0, 74.0, 69.0, 57.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "關於以上二段引文的敘述，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "甲段主旨在彰顯人性溫暖", "B": "甲段充分展現反諷性效果", "C": "乙段主旨在強調應信守承諾", "D": "乙段由悲而喜暗喻人生無常"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "10-11", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 66.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 66.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 97.0, 94.0, 85.0, 55.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據引文，符合作者觀點的選項是：", "options": {"A": "河流雖被破壞，人們還是能繼續生存，不會有絲毫改變", "B": "河流生命的迅速枯萎，起因於地層的自然變動", "C": "河流如被破壞，他所孕育的歷史文化光輝，將面臨終結", "D": "河流即使被攔腰截斷，也不會影響它源遠流長"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 89.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 94.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 89.0, "discrimination": 8.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 95.0, 94.0, 87.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據引文，作者認為臺灣河流面臨的災難是：", "options": {"A": "因為氣候暖化，將遭遇沙漠化", "B": "因為經常泛濫，隔絕了人河關係", "C": "因為現代人需水量大，河流將枯竭成為斷河", "D": "因為現代人不要河流，河流的生態遭受破壞"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 41.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 35.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 41.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 6.0, "p_quintiles": [42.0, 39.0, 38.0, 37.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "本文認為「極短篇」最重要的特色是：", "options": {"A": "使有限篇幅涵蘊無限旨趣", "B": "筆法極經濟而敘事極繁複", "C": "講究語言精練和刻畫細膩", "D": "為故事塑造個意外的結局"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-15", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 75.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 88.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 56.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 84.0, 80.0, 72.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
