{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句，完完完完全全全全沒沒沒沒有有有有錯別字的選項是：", "options": {"A": "民宿如雨後春筍般興起，良莠不齊，常讓遊客們眼花瞭亂", "B": "王先生做人行事有為有守，既不隨波逐流，也不故步自封", "C": "外籍勞工離鄉背景，常因人生地疏，舉目無親，而不知何去何從", "D": "林太太凡事喜歡追根究柢，鍥而不捨，不找到原因，絕不肯罷休", "E": "李小姐原本勤儉又快樂，嫁入豪門後，因價值觀相佐，悶悶不樂"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BD或ABD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 36.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 61.0, "D": 58.0, "E": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 27.0, "B": 67.0, "C": 46.0, "D": 76.0, "E": 37.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 40.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 39.0, "E": 61.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 49.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [55.0, 37.0, 28.0, 21.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句「」中的數字，表示「幾分之幾」意思的選項是：", "options": {"A": "三五明月滿，「四五」蟾兔缺", "B": "斬首十四級，捕虜「十一」人", "C": "古者稅什一而民足，今「百一」而民不足", "D": "天子、諸侯子「十九」而冠，冠而聽治，其教至也", "E": "會天寒，士卒墮指者「什二三」（「什」通「十」）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "CE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 19.0, "E": 76.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 88.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 61.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 81.0, 75.0, 67.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列「」內語詞，使用正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "怡君讀書總是「心凝形釋」，專注認真，終於如願考上理想的大學", "B": "阿嘉經歷失敗，以致失去鬥志，從此「一蹶不振」，頹靡度日", "C": "建宏愛好自然科學，做實驗向來「管窺蠡測」，謹慎細心絕不馬虎", "D": "張老闆為人「錙銖必較」，常與客戶發生爭執，生意因此一落千丈", "E": "兄弟象對統一獅那場球賽精彩至極，使人「繞樑三日」，難以忘懷"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 27.0, "B": 100.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 99.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 47.0, "B": 93.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 81.0, "E": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 82.0, 75.0, 66.0, 51.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "儒家思想，一脈相傳。下列前後文句意義相近的選項是：", "options": {"A": "己所不欲，勿施於人／施諸己而不願，亦勿施於人", "B": "以不教民戰，是謂棄之／不教民而用之，謂殃民", "C": "仁者先難而後獲／勞苦之事則爭先之，饒樂之事則能讓", "D": "言必信，行必果，硜硜然小人哉／大人者，言不必信，行不必果", "E": "始作俑者，其無後乎／率獸而食人，惡在其為民父母也"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABCD或ABCDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 95.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 29.0, "E": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 100.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 34.0, "E": 19.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 86.0, "B": 55.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [46.0, 40.0, 38.0, 34.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關經書的敘述，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "《詩經》是中國古代南方文學的總集", "B": "《尚書》保存了秦漢之際的典章制度", "C": "三禮指《周禮》、《儀禮》、《禮記》，其中《周禮》又稱《周官》", "D": "《易經》中的八卦可以代表八種不同的象，如乾卦代表天，坤卦代表地", "E": "《春秋》有《左傳》、《公羊傳》、《穀梁傳》三傳，《左傳》特點在詳述\n史事\n- 5 -\n100年學測 第 6 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "CDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 82.0, "E": 72.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 90.0, "E": 79.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 38.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 69.0, "E": 64.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 63.0, 54.0, 45.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下文後，選出正確的選項：\n每一句謊話都經過編號，打造成公車，開向都市的路口街邊搭載乘客。\n而後我們在顛簸的空間裏彼此擠壓，在紛亂的紅綠燈下左晃右盪。身心變形\n了，年老時下車的地點，卻仍是年輕時興奮的起站。（杜十三〈都市筆記〉）", "options": {"A": "本文旨在凸顯都市人的忙亂", "B": "本文寫作運用了諷諭的手法", "C": "本文強調都市人生活在謊言裏", "D": "本文認為謊言讓都市人身心變形", "E": "本文末二句意謂謊言讓都市人虛度一生"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BCDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 90.0, "C": 59.0, "D": 82.0, "E": 73.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 90.0, "E": 82.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 46.0, "D": 71.0, "E": 62.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 68.0, 63.0, 56.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下文後，選出正確的選項：\n人生的意義全是各人自己尋出來、造出來的：高尚、卑劣、清貴、污濁、有\n用、無用……，全靠自己的作為。生命本身不過是一件生物學的事實，有什麼意\n義可說？生一個人與一隻貓，一隻狗，有什麼分別？人生的意義不在於何以有\n生，而在於自己怎樣生活。你若情願把這六尺之軀葬送在白晝作夢之上，那就是\n你這一生的意義。你若發憤振作起來，決心去尋求生命的意義，去創造自己的生\n命的意義，那麼，你活一日便有一日的意義，做一事便添一事的意義，生命無窮，\n生命的意義也無窮了。（胡適〈人生有何意義〉）", "options": {"A": "作者主張眾生平等，人和貓狗沒有分別", "B": "作者認為「白晝作夢」也是生命的意義", "C": "「自己怎樣生活」是人生有無意義的關鍵", "D": "「生命無窮」是指人生有許多意外的遭遇", "E": "作者勸人創造自己生命的意義，無論是卑劣或污濁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 63.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 20.0, "E": 59.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 17.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 10.0, "E": 51.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 38.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 80.0, "D": 33.0, "E": 64.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 34.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [45.0, 37.0, 33.0, 28.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測100-chinese-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列詠史詩所歌詠的歷史人物，每一選項前後相同的是：", "options": {"A": "他年錦里經祠廟，梁父吟成恨有餘／出師未捷身先死，長使英雄淚滿襟", "B": "可憐夜半虛前席，不問蒼生問鬼神／雲邊雁斷胡天月，隴上羊歸塞草煙", "C": "回眸一笑百媚生，六宮粉黛無顏色／一騎紅塵妃子笑，無人知是荔枝來", "D": "東風不與周郎便，銅雀春深鎖二喬／江東子弟多才俊，捲土重來未可知", "E": "意態由來畫不成，當時枉殺毛延壽／玉顏流落死天涯，琵琶卻傳來漢家\n第第第第 貳貳貳貳 部部部部 分分分分 :非非非非 選選選選 擇擇擇擇 題題題題 （（（（ 共共共共 三三三三 大大大大 題題題題 ，，，， 占占占占 54 分分分分 ））））"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 54.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 28.0, "E": 71.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 69.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 10.0, "E": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 43.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 46.0, "E": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 60.0, 46.0, 32.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
